<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 13.1 pct yr/yr in Oct.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 13.1 pct yr/yr in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 13.1 percent year on year in October against a revised 14.3 percent rise in September, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.60 trillion baht in October from revised 3.59 trillion in September.</p>
<p>    M-2			 Oct 96    Sept 96	   Oct 95</p>
<p>    Money supply	     3.60     3.59		 3.18</p>
<p>    Percentage change	13.1     14.3		 19.5</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. The Bank of Thailand said October figure was an estimate.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
